      "content": "The 'low-value administrative review' sounds like a good way to categorize them for now. My concern is that when I look at the logs, it almost feels like these amounts are being chosen specifically because they are small enough to be ignored by the automated flags. It’s almost like there's some hidden logic to how they're being plucked out of the budget. If I can't find a specific person or process responsible, how should I describe these \"ghost\" transactions in my final summary to the management team? I don't want to sound paranoid, but I also don't want to leave them unexplained.",
